#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:2
msgid "Recruitment of participants for a study"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:4
msgid "Log in to Castellum by using your username and password"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:5
msgid "Click on **Recruitment**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:7
msgid ""
"2.1 If you see the message **There are currently no studies you can "
"recruit for** (or you do not find a study that you should recruit for), "
"please follow instruction 2.2. If you see the relevant study, go to step "
"3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:11
msgid ""
"2.2 Contact the responsible person who has access to the role "
"distribution of the study you wish to recruit for"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:13
msgid ""
"Click on **Find subjects** next to the study you want to recruit "
"participants for"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:15
msgid "By clicking on **Add**, relevant probands will be shown to you"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:16
msgid "Press the **Call** button to contact the person you want to reach"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:18
msgid ""
"**E-Mail address**, **Phone number**, a potential **Phone number "
"alternative** and the **Address** will be shown to you"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:20
msgid ""
"You might also see the **Preferred contact method**, if the person is "
"**currently available** and some **General recruiting notes**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:22
msgid ""
"Please have a look at the **Talking points** that the study coordinator "
"has defined"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:24
msgid "Call/Contact"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:25
msgid "Select a **Status of participation request**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:27
msgid "Choose between:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:29
msgid "**Not reached**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:30
msgid "**Unsuitable**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:32
msgid ""
"This may apply if attributes of the person do not comply with the "
"requirements of the study"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:35
msgid "**Invited** or"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:36
msgid "**Recall appointed**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:38
msgid "Determine the date and time of the recall appointment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:40
msgid ""
"When you select the **Status of participant request** and click on **Save"
" and show next**, the next contact person will be shown to you "
"automatically"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:45
msgid "Editing contact data and attributes; adding probands to the study"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:46
msgid "Click on **Edit contact data** in order to do so and press **Save**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:47
msgid ""
"By clicking **Edit attributes**, you can change characteristics of the "
"person that became known in the conversation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:49
msgid "When you press **Edit subject**, you can determine the **Privacy level**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:50
msgid "Settle the time-based **Availability** of the person"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/workflows/study-recruitment.rst:51
msgid "Press **Save** to record the progress"
msgstr ""

